    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n31 Harcourt Hall is a beautifully presented one-bedroom apartment ideally located in the heart of Dublin 2, offering the perfect blend of city convenience and comfortable living. Positioned within a well-maintained development on Charlotte Way, this attractive residence is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, investors, and those seeking a stylish city-centre home.\n\nThe accommodation is bright and well-proportioned throughout, comprising an inviting entrance hall, a spacious open-plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, a generous double bedroom with built in storage, and a modern bathroom. Large windows allow for an abundance of natural light, creating a welcoming and airy atmosphere.\n\nThe location is second to none, with Dublin's vibrant city centre on the doorstep. Residents can enjoy a wealth of cafés, restaurants, shops, and cultural amenities within walking distance, while excellent transport links, including the Luas at Harcourt Street, provide easy access to all parts of the city."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.12m x 1.01m\nWarm and welcoming entrance hall giving access to the living/dining room.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 3.60m x 3.39m\nBright and spacious living / dining room with two large windows flooding the room natural light and giving access to the kitchen.\n\nKitchen - 1.75m x 2.29m\nWell-appointed kitchen with oven, hob and extractor fan, washing drier and tall fridge freezer, completed with wall mounted storage.\n\nBedroom - 2.48m x 3.39m\nDouble bedroom with built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 2.18m x 2.29m\nTiled floor and splashback window for natural light and ventilation.\n\n"
      },
